shploingus.recipe/3
package	alpha-shell	v1-alpha
# The shell package, version 3. **A window has exactly one home**, and the rows at
# the foot of this file are the homes:
#
#   tab    a bar tab (the six the user ruled, H-15.2), drawn in strip order
#   bar    a bar entry that is not a tab — the console, the command surface (H-8.2)
#   filed  a window a tab's menu offers (H-15.3: a tab sorts the windows)
#   pin    a window hosted in the HUD while the shell is hidden (H-9.8)
#
# A declared window with **none** of the first three is console-opened: `log`,
# `streamer` and `governance` are reached by id from the console (H-15.2, H-15.5).
# The console opens any declared window, so nothing is unreachable.
#
# The eight tabs of UI-SPEC §5 were cut to six by the user: `governance` and `tools`
# left the bar. UI-SPEC §5's table is corrected in the record, not rewritten here.
window	inventory
	title	Inventory / crafting
	content	inventory
	panel	class:CitadelHudHeroShop
	scale	35
	lane	tab
	extent	square-pixels
	geometry	16 64 672 378
	min-size	240 192
	opacity	930
	elevation	1
	theme-role	surface
	pinnable	true
	layout	minimize,maximize,close,title-position
	behavior	drag,resize,maximize,minimize,close
	record-id	window-inventory
